{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>姚焯菲（Chantel）雖然平日工作與學業兩忙，但仍不時在社交平台分享生活點滴與粉絲互動。日前，姚焯菲上載了一輯私下親自下廚的日常靚相與短片，化身「美女廚師」展現廚藝！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"0d587dda-d186-4269-a0a7-57816fa049f3.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026c6gOVoOjcz1789982484.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"0d587dda-d186-4269-a0a7-57816fa049f3.png.webp\"/></div></div><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_45af8c12a9045c42-480\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>相中所見，雖然姚焯菲在下廚期間不小心切親手，手指公貼上了膠布，但依然無損她的好心情，興奮地向大家展示其親手製作的各式美味料理。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_45af8c12a9045c42-480\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"620b9186-42f4-4ce3-bcfb-8d7395641a29.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20269MexgkRQqw1789982484.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"620b9186-42f4-4ce3-bcfb-8d7395641a29.jpg.webp\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"c6bf7ddf-90ee-4385-8c00-4ccafa827483.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026OvC7iWmdXH1789982483.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"c6bf7ddf-90ee-4385-8c00-4ccafa827483.jpg.webp\"/></div></div><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_45af8c12a9045c42-481\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>其中一張照片中，她換上休閒背心大騷纖腰，捧著自己親手做的美食，賣相看上去色香味俱全。帖文吸引了大批粉絲留言讚好：「好想試下 Chantel 嘅手藝」、「好叻女，但下次要小心啲啦，唔好受傷！」</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-21T09:58:38.740041+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":244,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}